%% Partner push over REST / gRPC / SOAP
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Partner
  participant WAF as WAF + API gateway
  participant GW as ingestion-gateway
  participant KV as Valkey (nonces)
  participant OBJ as Object storage
  participant PG as PostgreSQL primary

  P->>WAF: POST batch (mTLS client cert, Idempotency-Key, signature over body+timestamp+nonce)
  WAF->>GW: forward (rate-limited, size-limited)
  GW->>GW: verify certificate pin, signature, timestamp window
  GW->>KV: SET nonce NX EX 300
  alt nonce reused or stale
    GW-->>P: 401 problem details (no internals)
  else accepted
    GW->>GW: validate against contract (depth, sizes, unknown fields rejected)
    GW->>OBJ: store payload as raw artifact
    GW->>PG: tx: raw_artifact + ingestion_run (idempotency key) + outbox
    GW-->>P: 202 + run public_id (per-record results available via status API)
  end
